				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Seriously,why is this even allowed on the main list?</p> </blockquote> <p>Probably because it was originally written in 2011.</p> <blockquote> <p>2. This would make a LEGENDARY -J, up there with ___, which this reminded me of.</p> </blockquote> <p>Eh&#8230; not necessarily. This is an object that actually exists in the SCP-verse as-is, whereas joke SCPs are not meant to be taken seriously.</p> <blockquote> <p>3. If teleporting ducks are anomalous objects, and it has been stated MANY times before SCPs need a practical or scientific value, HOW is this an SCP?</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>4. It's a bowl. It makes people use haiku. Big fucking deal. There's no substance, no hook, no nothing.</p> </blockquote> <p>See answer to #1. Site standards were different seven years ago.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-343775#post-4090419</guid>
