					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Seriously,why is this even allowed on the main list?</p> <p>1. As mentioned by a few commenters , this is <em>actually kind of offensive</em>, and isn't even actual haiku</p> <p>2. This would make a LEGENDARY -J, up there with ___, which this reminded me of.</p> <p>3. If teleporting ducks are anomalous objects, and it has been stated MANY times before SCPs need a practical or scientific value, HOW is this an SCP?</p> <p>4. It's a bowl. It makes people use haiku. Big fucking deal. There's no substance, no hook, no nothing.</p> <p>FAT downvote from me.</p> 
				 	]]>
