				<wikidot:authorName>MrWrong</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2039383</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You might want to make sure that the number of syllables fit the haiku scheme (it's 5-7-5).</p> <p>Let me suggest this haiku instead.</p> <blockquote> <p>Crosstest Permitted:<br /> This with <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2673">two-six-seven-three</a><br /> Locked up in haiku.</p> </blockquote> <p>Trivia: In Japanese, 'haiku' would be considered as three syllables (ha-i-ku) but it is two in English (hai-ku).</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
