				<wikidot:authorName>Accelerando</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1599414</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>From the tag guide:</p> <blockquote> <p>A meta object is an object that affects its documentation, is affected by its documentation, or has containment procedures that extend to its documentation.</p> </blockquote> <p>Sometimes an article can just change the way it's written, or have containment procedures revolving around the article itself. All format screws are tagged with meta, but not all articles tagged with meta are format screws.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
